flowchart LR
    Y["The generator is<br/>suspended at a yield"] --> N["next(g) resumes it,<br/>and the yield<br/>evaluates to None"]
    Y --> S["g.send(v) resumes it,<br/>and the yield<br/>evaluates to v"]
    Y --> C["g.close() resumes it<br/>by raising GeneratorExit<br/>at the yield"]
    N --> F["Whichever of the three<br/>ends it, a finally in<br/>the generator still runs"]
    S --> F
    C --> F
